WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.812
To measure legislative complicity, 340 Members of Parliament have been algorithmically scored.

00:00:06.762 --> 00:00:16.237
This metric cross-references their voting records on major bills, such as C-7, against documented lobbying contacts and political donations.

00:00:16.237 --> 00:00:22.837
113 MPs demonstrated clean records, while the rest displayed significant conflicts.
